acial bonus on Jump checks and a +8 racial bonus on Spot checks (using the modifiers given in parentheses). *All devastation spiders gain a +8 competence bonus on Hide and Move Silently checks when using their webs.</p>\n</div>\n</div><div topic=\"Devastation Scorpion\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Devastation Scorpion</h3></p><div topic=\"Improved Grab\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Improved Grab (Ex):</b> To use this ability, the devastation scorpion must hit with its claw attack. If it gets a hold, it hangs on and squeezes.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Squeeze\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Squeeze (Ex):</b> A devastation scorpion that gets a hold on a Gargantuan or smaller opponent automatically deals damage with both claws and its sting.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Poison\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Poison (Ex):</b> Sting, Fort save (DC 95); initial and secondary damage 2d12 temporary Str.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Skills\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Skills:</b> Devastation scorpions receive a +4 racial bonus on Climb, Hide, and Spot checks.</p>\n</div>\n</div><div topic=\"Devastation Beetle\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Devastation Beetle</h3></p><div topic=\"Trample\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Trample (Ex):</b> A devastation beetle can trample Gargantuan and smaller creatures for 30d10+24 points of damage. Opponents who do not make attacks of opportunity against the devastation beetle can attempt a Reflex save (DC 90) to halve the damage.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Acid Cloud\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Acid Cloud (Ex):</b> A devastation beetle exudes a constant vapor that radiates outward in every direction for 60 feet. This vapor deals 6d6 points of acid damage each round to anyone caught in the cloud.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 EpicMonsters(A-E)');
INSERT INTO monster VALUES (21,'Dragon, Epic','Force Dragon, Wyrmling',NULL,'Huge','Dragon','Force','20d12+100 (230 hp)','+4','60 ft., fly 250 ft. (poor)','31 (-2 size, +4 deflection, +19 natural), touch 12, flat-footed 31','+20','+38','Bite +29 (2d8+10) melee','Bite +29 (2d8+10) melee, 2 Claws +29 (2d6+5) melee, 2 Wings +28 (1d8+5) melee, Tail Slap +28 (2d6+15) melee','15 ft.','10 ft. (15 ft. with bite)','Breath weapon (50 ft. cone of force 5d12, DC 25), crush 2d8+15 (DC 25), frightful presence (DC 24), tail sweep 2d4+15 (DC 25)','Blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 10/magic, darkvision 120 ft., deflecting force, immune to force, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, spell resistance 24, spells (caster level 3rd)','Fort +17, Ref +12, Will +16','Str 31, Dex 10, Con 21, Int 18, Wis 19, Cha 18','Concentration +25, Diplomacy +23, Escape Artist +19, Intimidate +23, Knowledge (any 3) +27, Listen +29, Search +27, Sense Motive +23, Spot +29, Use Magic Device +23',NULL,'Alertness, Empower Spell, Hover, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)',NULL,'Any land and underground','Solitary or clutch (2-5)','13','Double standard','Usually neutral','21-24 HD (Huge)','-','Blindsense (Ex), Blur (Su), Breath Weapon (Su), Crush (Ex), Deflecting Force (Su), Displacement (Su), Frightful Presence (Ex), Immune to Force (Ex), Immunities (Ex), Invisibility (Su), Keen Senses (Ex), Spell Resistance (Ex), Tail Sweep (Ex)','Wyrmling force dragon; CR 13; Huge dragon (force); HD 20d12+100; hp 230; Init +4; Spd 60 ft., fly 250 ft. (poor); AC 31 (-2 size, +4 deflection, +19 natural), touch 12, flat-footed 31; Base Atk +20; Grp +38; Atk +29 melee (2d8+10, bite); Full Atk +29 melee (2d8+10, bite) and +29 melee (2d6+5, 2 claws) and +28 melee (1d8+5, 2 wings) and +28 melee (2d6+15, tail slap); Space/Reach 15 ft./10 ft. (15 ft. with bite); SA Breath weapon (50 ft. cone of force 5d12, DC 25), crush 2d8+15 (DC 25), frightful presence (DC 24), tail sweep 2d4+15 (D