flat-footed 64; Base Atk +45; Grp +77; Atk +62 melee (4d6+20, bite); Full Atk +62 melee (4d6+20, bite) and +62 melee (2d8+10, 2 claws) and +61 melee (2d6+10, 2 wings) and +62 melee (2d8+30, tail slap); Space/Reach 20 ft./15 ft. (20 ft. with bite); SA Breath weapon (60 ft. cone of force 30d12, DC 45), crush 4d6+30 (DC 45), frightful presence (DC 46), tail sweep 2d6+30 (DC 45); SQ Blindsense 60 ft., blur, damage reduction 15/epic, darkvision 120 ft., immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, resilient sphere, spell resistance 39, spells (caster level 18th), wall of force; AL N; SV Fort +37, Ref +24, Will +38; Str 51, Dex 10, Con 37, Int 38, Wis 39, Cha 38\n\nSkills and Feats: Appraise +18, Bluff +18, Concentration +61, Craft (alchemy) +18, Diplomacy +62, Disable Device +18, Escape Artist +48, Gather Information +18, Heal +18, Hide -8, Intimidate +62, Jump +24, Knowledge (all) +62, Listen +64, Move Silently +4, Open Lock +4, Search +62, Sense Motive +62, Spellcraft +18, Spot +64, Survival +18, Tumble +4, Use Magic Device +62; Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Combat Reflexes, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Improved Sunder, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Weapon Focus (tail slap), Wingover','\n      <div topic=\"Force Dragon\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Force Dragon</h3></p><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Force Dragon, Adult</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Gargantuan Dragon (Force)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>45d12+585 (877 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>60 ft., fly 300 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td><td>64 (-4 size, +14