(-8 size, +16 deflection, +49 natural), touch 18, flat-footed 67; Base Atk +50; Grp +88; Atk +65 melee (4d8+22/19-20, bite); Full Atk +65 melee (4d8+22/19-20, bite) and +65 melee (4d6+11, 2 claws) and +64 melee (2d8+11, 2 wings) and +65 melee (4d6+33, tail slap); Space/Reach 30 ft./20 ft. (30 ft. with bite); SA Breath weapon (70 ft. cone of force 35d12, DC 50), crush 4d8+33 (DC 50), frightful presence (DC 51), tail sweep 2d8+33 (DC 50); SQ Blindsense 60 ft., blur, damage reduction 20/epic, darkvision 120 ft., immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, resilient sphere, spell resistance 42, spells (caster level 21st), wall of force; AL N; SV Fort +42, Ref +27, Will +43; Str 55, Dex 10, Con 41, Int 42, Wis 43, Cha 42\n\nSkills and Feats: Appraise +25, Bluff +25, Concentration +68, Craft (alchemy) +25, Diplomacy +69, Disable Device +25, Escape Artist +53, Gather Information +25, Heal +25, Hide -7, Intimidate +69, Jump +31, Knowledge (all) +69, Listen +71, Move Silently +9, Open Lock +9, Search +69, Sense Motive +69, Spellcraft +25, Spot +71, Survival +25, Tumble +9, Use Magic Device +69; Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Combat Reflexes, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Critical (bite), Improved Initiative, Improved Sunder, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Weapon Focus (tail slap), Wingover','\n      <div topic=\"Force Dragon\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Force Dragon</h3></p><p/><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Force Dragon, Mature adult</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Colossal Dragon (Force)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>50d12+750 (1,075 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>60 ft., fly 300 ft. (clumsy)<