flat-footed 64; Base Atk +48; Grp +83; Atk +60 melee (4d8+19/19-20, bite); Full Atk +60 melee (4d8+19/19-20, bite) and +60 melee (4d6+9, 2 claws) and +59 melee (2d8+9, 2 wings) and +60 melee (4d6+28, tail slap); Space/Reach 30 ft./20 ft. (30 ft. with bite); SA Breath weapon (70 ft. prismatic spray effect, DC 49), crush 4d8+28 (DC 49), frightful presence (DC 49), tail sweep 2d8+28 (DC 49); SQ Blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 15/epic, darkvision 120 ft., immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, rainbow pattern, spell resistance 54, spells (caster level 20th), sunbeam; AL N; SV Fort +41, Ref +26, Will +41; Str 49, Dex 10, Con 41, Int 40, Wis 41, Cha 40\n\nSkills and Feats: Appraise +21, Bluff +21, Concentration +66, Craft (alchemy) +21, Diplomacy +66, Disable Device +21, Escape Artist +51, Gather Information +21, Heal +21, Hide -10, Intimidate +66, Jump +25, Knowledge (all) +66, Listen +68, Move Silently +6, Open Lock +6, Search +66, Sense Motive +66, Spellcraft +21, Spot +68, Survival +21, Tumble +6, Use Magic Device +66; Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Combat Reflexes, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Critical (bite), Improved Initiative, Improved Sunder, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Weapon Focus (tail slap), Wingover','\n      <div topic=\"Prismatic Dragon\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Prismatic Dragon</h3></p><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Prismatic Dragon, Adult</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Colossal Dragon (Light)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>48d12+720 (1,032 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>60 ft., fly 300 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Armor C