; Spd 60 ft., fly 300 ft. (clumsy); AC 78 (-8 size, +19 deflection, +57 natural), touch 21, flat-footed 78; Base Atk +58; Grp +97; Atk +74 melee (4d8+23/19-20, bite); Full Atk +74 melee (4d8+23/19-20, bite) and +74 melee (4d6+11/19-20, 2 claws) and +73 melee (2d8+11/19-20, 2 wings) and +74 melee (4d6+34, tail slap); Space/Reach 30 ft./20 ft. (30 ft. with bite); SA Breath weapon (70 ft. prismatic spray effect, DC 58), crush 4d8+34 (DC 58), frightful presence (DC 58), tail sweep 2d8+34 (DC 58); SQ Blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 20/epic, darkvision 120 ft., immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, rainbow pattern, spell resistance 66, spells (caster level 26th), sunbeam, sunburst; AL N; SV Fort +50, Ref +31, Will +50; Str 57, Dex 10, Con 49, Int 48, Wis 49, Cha 48\n\nSkills and Feats: Appraise +36, Bluff +36, Concentration +80, Craft (alchemy) +36, Diplomacy +80, Disable Device +36, Escape Artist +61, Gather Information +36, Heal +36, Hide +1, Intimidate +80, Jump +40, Knowledge (all) +80, Listen +82, Move Silently +17, Open Lock +17, Search +80, Sense Motive +80, Spellcraft +36, Spot +82, Survival +36, Tumble +17, Use Magic Device +80; Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Combat Reflexes, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Great Cleave, Hover, Improved Critical (bite), Improved Critical (claws), Improved Critical (wings), Improved Initiative, Improved Sunder, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Weapon Focus (tail slap), Wingover','\n      <div topic=\"Prismatic Dragon\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Prismatic Dragon</h3></p><p/><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Prismatic Dragon, Old</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Colossal Dragon (Light)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>58d12+1,102 (1,479 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiati