prismatic dragon; CR 61; Colossal+ dragon (light); HD 73d12+1,825; hp 2,299; Init +4; Spd 60 ft., fly 350 ft. (clumsy); AC 99 (-8 size, +25 deflection, +72 natural), touch 27, flat-footed 99; Base Atk +73; Grp +118; Atk +95 melee (8d6+29/19-20, bite); Full Atk +95 melee (8d6+29/19-20, bite) and +95 melee (4d8+14/19-20, 2 claws) and +94 melee (4d6+14/19-20, 2 wings) and +95 melee (4d8+43, tail slap); Space/Reach 30 ft./20 ft. (30 ft. with bite); SA Breath weapon (80 ft. prismatic spray effect, DC 71), crush 8d6+43 (DC 71), frightful presence (DC 71), tail sweep 4d6+43 (DC 71); SQ Blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 25/epic, darkvision 120 ft., immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, prismatic wall, rainbow pattern, spell resistance 80, spells (caster level 35th), sunbeam, sunburst; AL N; SV Fort +63, Ref +38, Will +63; Str 69, Dex 10, Con 61, Int 60, Wis 61, Cha 60\n\nSkills and Feats: Appraise +63, Bluff +63, Concentration +101, Craft (alchemy) +63, Diplomacy +101, Disable Device +63, Escape Artist +76, Gather Information +63, Heal +63, Hide +22, Intimidate +101, Jump +67, Knowledge (all) +101, Listen +103, Move Silently +38, Open Lock +38, Search +101, Sense Motive +101, Spellcraft +63, Spot +103, Survival +63, Tumble +38, Use Magic Device +101; Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Combat Reflexes, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Great Cleave, Hover, Improved Critical (bite), Improved Critical (claws), Improved Critical (wings), Improved Initiative, Improved Spell Capacity (x3), Improved Sunder, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Spell Knowledge (x2), Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Weapon Focus (tail slap), Wingover','\n      <div topic=\"Prismatic Dragon\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Prismatic Dragon</h3></p><p/><p/><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Prismatic Dragon, Wyrm</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Colossal+ Dragon (Li