 family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Challenge Rating\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Challenge Rating:</b> Wyrmling 14; very young 16; young 22; juvenile 30; young adult 34; adult 39; mature adult 43; old 48; very old 52; ancient 57; wyrm 61; great wyrm 66</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Treasure\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Treasure:</b> Double standard</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Alignment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alignment:</b> Usually neutral</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Advancement\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Advancement:</b> Wyrmling 24-27 HD (Huge); very young 29-32 HD (Huge); young 34-37 HD (Gargantuan); juvenile 39-42 HD (Gargantuan); young adult 44-47 HD (Gargantuan); adult 49-52 HD (Gargantuan); mature adult 54-57 HD (Colossal); old 59-62 HD (Colossal); very old 64-67 HD (Colossal); ancient 69-72 HD (Colossal+); wyrm 74-77 HD (Colossal+); great wyrm 79+ HD (Colossal+)</p><p/>\n</div><div topic=\"Prismatic Dragons by Age\" level=\"5\"><p><h5><b>Prismatic Dragons by Age</b> </h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td><b>Age</b> <br/></td>\n<td><b>Size</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Hit Dice (hp)</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Str</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Dex</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Con</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Int</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Wis</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Cha</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Base Attack/</b><br/>\n<b>Grapple</b><br/></td> <td><b>Attack</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Fort Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Ref Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Will Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Breath Weapon DC</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Frightful Presence DC</b><br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Wyrmling<br/></td>\n<td>H<br/></td>\n<td>23d12+138 (287)<br/></td>\n<td>29<br/></td>\n<td>10<br/></td>\n<td>23<br/></td>\n<td>20<br/></td>\n<td>21<br/></td>\n<td>20<br/></td>\n<td>+23/+40<br/></td>\n<td>+30<br/></td>\n<td>+19<br/></td>\n<td>+13<br/></td>\n<td>+18<br/></td>\n<td>27<br/></td>\n<td>26<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxc