n<td>+23<br/></td>\n<td>+16<br/></td>\n<td>+21<br/></td>\n<td>16d10 (31)<br/></td>\n<td>29<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Very old<br/></td>\n<td>G<br/></td>\n<td>31d12+248 (449)<br/></td>\n<td>37<br/></td>\n<td>10<br/></td>\n<td>27<br/></td>\n<td>22<br/></td>\n<td>23<br/></td>\n<td>22<br/></td>\n<td>+31/+56<br/></td>\n<td>+40<br/></td>\n<td>+25<br/></td>\n<td>+17<br/></td>\n<td>+23<br/></td>\n<td>18d10 (33)<br/></td>\n<td>31<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Ancient<br/></td>\n<td>G<br/></td>\n<td>34d12+306 (527)<br/></td>\n<td>39<br/></td>\n<td>10<br/></td>\n<td>29<br/></td>\n<td>24<br/></td>\n<td>25<br/></td>\n<td>24<br/></td>\n<td>+34/+60<br/></td>\n<td>+44<br/></td>\n<td>+28<br/></td>\n<td>+19<br/></td>\n<td>+26<br/></td>\n<td>20d10 (36)<br/></td>\n<td>34<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Wyrm<br/></td>\n<td>G<br/></td>\n<td>37d12+370 (610)<br/></td>\n<td>41<br/></td>\n<td>10<br/></td>\n<td>31<br/></td>\n<td>24<br/></td>\n<td>25<br/></td>\n<td>24<br/></td>\n<td>+37/+64<br/></td>\n<td>+48<br/></td>\n<td>+30<br/></td>\n<td>+20<br/></td>\n<td>+27<br/></td>\n<td>22d10 (38)<br/></td>\n<td>35<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Great wyrm<br/></td>\n<td>C<br/></td>\n<td>40d12+400 (660)<br/></td>\n<td>45<br/></td>\n<td>10<br/></td>\n<td>31<br/></td>\n<td>26<br/></td>\n<td>27<br/></td>\n<td>26<br/></td>\n<td>+40/+73<br/></td>\n<td>+49<br/></td>\n<td>+32<br/></td>\n<td>+22<br/></td>\n<td>+30<br/></td>\n<td>24d10 (40)<br/></td>\n<td>38<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n</table><p/>\n</div><div topic=\"Red Dragon Abilities by Age\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Red Dragon Abilities by Age</h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td><b>Age</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Speed</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Initiative</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>AC</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Special Abilities</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Caster Level</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>SR</b><br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Wyrmling<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>16 (+6 natural), touch 10, flat-footed 16<br/></td>\n<td>Immunity to fire, vulnerability to cold<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Very young<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>18 (-1 size, +9 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 18<br/></td>\n<td/>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Young<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>21 (-1 size, +12 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 21<br/></td>\n<td/>\n<td>1st<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Juvenile<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>24 (-1 size, +15 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 24<br/></td>\n<td><i>Locate object</i><br/></td>\n<td>3rd<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Young adult<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>26 (-2 size, +18 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 26<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 5/magic<br/></td>\n<td>5th<br/></td>\n<td>19<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Adult<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>29 (-2 size, +21 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 29<br/></td>\n<td/>\n<td>7th<br/></td>\n<td>21<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Mature adult<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>32 (-2 size, +24 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 32<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 10/magic<br/></td>\n<td>9th<br/></td>\n<td>23<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Old<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>33 (-4 size, +27 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 33<br/></td>\n<td><i>Suggestion</i><br/></td>\n<td>11th<br/></td>\n<td>24<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Very old<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>36 (-4 size, +30 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 36<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 15/magic<br/></td>\n<td>13th<br/></td>\n<td>26<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Ancient<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>39 (-4 size, +33 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 39<br/></td>\n<td><i>Find the path</i><br/></td>\n<td>15th<br/></td>\n<td>28<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Wyrm<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>42 (-4 size, +36 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 42<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 20/magic<br/></td>\n<td>17th<br/></td>\n<td>30<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Great wyrm<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>41 (-8 size, +39 natural), touch 2, flat-footed 41<br/></td>\n<td><i>Discern location</i><br/></td>\n<td>19th<br/></td>\n<td>32<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"2\">\n<td colspan=\"7\">*Can also cast cleric spells and those from the Chaos, Evil, and Fire domains as arcane spells.<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n</table><p>The small scales of a wyrmling red dragon are a bright glossy scarlet, making the dragon easily spotted by predators and hunters, so it stays underground and does not venture outside until it is more able to take care of itself. Toward the end of young age, the scales turn a deeper red, and the glossy texture is replaced by a smooth, dull finish. As the dragon grows older, the scales become large, thick, and as strong as metal. The neck frill and wings are an ash blue or purple-gray toward the edges, becoming darker with age. The pupils of a red dragon fade as it ages; the oldest red dragons have eyes that resemble molten lava orbs.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Combat\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Combat</h5></p><p>Because red dragons are so confident, they seldom pause to appraise an adversary. On spotting a target, they make a snap decision whether to attack, using one of many strategies worked out ahead of time. A red dragon lands to attack small, weak creatures with its claws and bite rather than obliterating them with its breath weapon, so as not to destroy any treasure they might be carrying.</p><div topic=\"Breath Weapon\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Breath Weapon (Su):</b> A red dragon has one type of breath weapon, a cone of fire.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Locate Object\" level=\"8\"><p><b><i>Locate Object</i> (Sp):</b> A juvenile or older red dragon can use this ability as the spell of the same name, once per day per age category.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Other Spell-Like Abilities\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Other Spell-Like Abilities:</b> 3/day-<i>suggestion</i> (old or older); 1/day-<i>find the path</i> (ancient or older), <i>discern location</i> (great wyrm).</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Skills\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Skills:</b> Appraise, Bluff, and Jump are considered class skills for red dragons.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 MonstersDr-Dw');
INSERT INTO monster VALUES (248,'Dragon, True','Red Dragon, Juvenile',NULL,'Large','Dragon','Fire','16d12+64 (168 hp)','+4','40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)','24 (-1 size, +15 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 24','+16','+29','Bite +25 (2d6+9) melee','Bite +25 (2d6+9) melee, 2 Claws +25 (1d8+4) melee, 2 Wings +24 (1d6+4) melee, Tail Slap +24 (1d8+13) melee','10 ft.','5 ft. (10 ft. with bite)','Breath weapon (40 ft. cone of fire 8d10, DC 22)','Blindsense 60 ft., darkvision 120 ft., immunity to fire, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, locate object, spells (caster level 3rd), vulnerability to cold','Fort +14, Ref +10, Will +12','Str 29, Dex 10, Con 19, Int 14, Wis 15, Cha 14','Appraise +10, Bluff +10, Concentration +12, Diplomacy +10, Escape Artist +8, Intimidate +10, Jump +17, Knowledge (any 2) +21, Listen +23, Search +21, Sense Motive +10, Spot +23, Use Magic Device +10',NULL,'Alertness, Hover, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)',NULL,'Warm mountains','Solitary or clutch (2-5)','10','Triple standard','Always chaotic evil','17-18 HD (Large)','-','Blindsense (Ex), Breath Weapon (Su), Crush (Ex), Frightful Presence (Ex), Immunities (Ex), Keen Senses (Ex), Locate Object (Sp), Spell Resistance (Ex), Tail Sweep (Ex)','Juvenile red dragon; CR 10; Large dragon (fire); HD 16d12+64; hp 168; Init +4; Spd 40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor); AC 24 (-1 size, +15 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 24; Base Atk +16; Grp +29; Atk +25 melee (2d6+9, bite); Full Atk +25 melee (2d6+9, bite) and +25 melee (1d8+4, 2 claws) and +24 melee (1d6+4, 2 wings) and +24 melee (1d8+13, tail slap); Space/Reach 10 ft./5 ft. (10 ft. with bite); SA Breath weapon (40 ft. cone of fire 8d10, DC 22); SQ Blindsense 60 ft., darkvision 120 ft., immunity to fire, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, locate object, spells (caster level 3rd), vulnerability to cold; AL CE; SV Fort +14, Ref +10, Will +12; Str 29, Dex 10, Con 19, Int 14, Wis 15, Cha 14\n\nSkills and Feats: Appraise +10, Bluff +10, Concentration +12, Diplomacy +10, Escape Artist +8, Intimidate +10, Jump +17, Knowledge (any 2) +21, Listen +23, Search +21, Sense Motive +10, Spot +23, Use Magic Device +10; Alertness, Hover, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)','\n      <div topic=\"Red Dragon\" level=\"4\"><p><h4>Red Dragon</h4></p><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Red Dragon, Juvenile</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Large Dragon (Fire)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>16d12+64 (168 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td><td>24 (-1 size, +15 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 24<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td><td>+16/+29<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +25 (2d6+9) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +25 (2d6+9) melee, 2 Claws +25 (1d8+4) melee, 2 Wings +24 (1d6+4) melee, Tail Slap +24 (1d8+13) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td><td>10 ft./5 ft. (10 ft. with bite)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td><td>Breath weapon (40 ft. cone of fire 8d10, DC 22)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td><td>Blindsense 60 ft., darkvision 120 ft., immunity to fire, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, <i>locate object</i>, spells (caster level 3rd), vulnerability to cold<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td><td>Fort +14, Ref +10, Will +12<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td><td>Str 29, Dex 10, Con 19, Int 14, Wis 15, Cha 14<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td><td>Appraise +10, Bluff +10, Concentration +12, Diplomacy +10, Escape Artist +8, Intimidate +10, Jump +17, Knowledge (any 2) +21, Listen +23, Search +21, Sense Motive +10, Spot +23, Use Magic Device +10<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td><td>Alertness, Hover, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td><td>Warm mountains<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td><td>Solitary or clutch (2-5)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td><td>10<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td><td>Triple standard<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td><td>Always chaotic evil<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td><td>17-18 HD (Large)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td><td>-<br/></td></tr>\n\n</table><p/><p/><p/><div topic=\"Dragon\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Dragon (Fire)</b></p>\n</div><div topic=\"Environment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Environment:</b> Warm mountains</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Organization\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Organization:</b> Wyrmling, very young, young, juvenile, and young adult: solitary or clutch (2-5); adult, mature adult, old, very old, ancient, wyrm, or great wyrm: solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Challenge Ratings\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Challenge Ratings:</b> Wyrmling 4; very young 5; young 7; juvenile 10; young adult 13; adult 15; mature adult 18; old 20; very old 21; ancient 23; wyrm 24; great wyrm 26</p>\n</