38), crush 4d6+22 (DC 38), frightful presence (DC 35), tail sweep 2d6+22 (DC 38); SQ Blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 20/magic, darkvision 120 ft., find the path, immunity to fire, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, locate object, spell resistance 30, spells (caster level 17th), suggestion, vulnerability to cold; AL CE; SV Fort +30, Ref +20, Will +27; Str 41, Dex 10, Con 31, Int 24, Wis 25, Cha 24\n\nSkills and Feats: Appraise +42, Bluff +42, Concentration +46, Diplomacy +42, Escape Artist +35, Intimidate +42, Jump +50, Knowledge (any 3) +47, Listen +49, Search +47, Sense Motive +42, Spot +49, Use Magic Device +42; Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Wingover','\n      <div topic=\"Red Dragon\" level=\"4\"><p><h4>Red Dragon</h4></p><p/><p/><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Red Dragon, Wyrm</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Gargantuan Dragon (Fire)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>37d12+370 (610 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td><td>42 (-4 size, +36 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 42<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td><td>+37/+64<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +49 (4d6+15) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +49 (4d6+15) melee, 2 Claws +49 (2d8+7) melee, 2 Wings +48 (2d6+7) melee, Tail Slap +48 (2d8+22) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol