37/+64<br/></td>\n<td>+48<br/></td>\n<td>+30<br/></td>\n<td>+20<br/></td>\n<td>+27<br/></td>\n<td>22d10 (38)<br/></td>\n<td>35<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Great wyrm<br/></td>\n<td>C<br/></td>\n<td>40d12+400 (660)<br/></td>\n<td>45<br/></td>\n<td>10<br/></td>\n<td>31<br/></td>\n<td>26<br/></td>\n<td>27<br/></td>\n<td>26<br/></td>\n<td>+40/+73<br/></td>\n<td>+49<br/></td>\n<td>+32<br/></td>\n<td>+22<br/></td>\n<td>+30<br/></td>\n<td>24d10 (40)<br/></td>\n<td>38<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n</table><p/>\n</div><div topic=\"Red Dragon Abilities by Age\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Red Dragon Abilities by Age</h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td><b>Age</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Speed</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Initiative</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>AC</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Special Abilities</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Caster Level</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>SR</b><br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Wyrmling<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>16 (+6 natural), touch 10, flat-footed 16<br/></td>\n<td>Immunity to fire, vulnerability to cold<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Very young<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>18 (-1 size, +9 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 18<br/></td>\n<td/>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Young<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>21 (-1 size, +12 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 21<br/></td>\n<td/>\n<td>1st<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Juvenile<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>24 (-1 size, +15 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 24<br/></td>\n<td><i>Locate object</i><br/></td>\n<td>3rd<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Young adult<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>26 (-2 size, +18 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 26<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 5/magic<br/></td>\n<td>5th<br/></td>\n<td>19<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Adult<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>29 (-2 size, +21 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 29<br/></td>\n<td/>\n<td>7th<br/></td>\n<td>21<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Mature adult<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>32 (-2 size, +24 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 32<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 10/magic<br/></td>\n<td>9th<br/></td>\n<td>23<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Old<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>33 (-4 size, +27 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 33<br/></td>\n<td><i>Suggestion</i><br/></td>\n<td>11th<br/></td>\n<td>24<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Very old<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>36 (-4 size, +30 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 36<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 15/magic<br/></td>\n<td>13th<br/></td>\n<td>26<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Ancient<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>39 (-4 size, +33 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 39<br/></td>\n<td><i>Find the path</i><br/></td>\n<td>15th<br/></td>\n<td>28<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Wyrm<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>42 (-4 size, +36 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 42<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 20/magic<br/></td>\n<td>17th<br/></td>\n<td>30<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Great wyrm<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>41 (-8 size, +39 natural), touch 2, flat-footed 41<br/></td>\n<td><i>Discern location</i><br/></td>\n<td>19th<br/></td>\n<td>32<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"2\">\n<td colspan=\"7\">*Can also cast cleric spells and those from the Chaos, Evil, and Fire domains as arcane spells.<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n</table><p>The small scales of a wyrmling red dragon are a bright glossy scarlet, making the dragon easily spotted by predators and hunters, so it stays underground and does not venture outside until it is more able to take care of itself. Toward the end of young age, the scales turn a deeper red, and the glossy texture is replaced by a smooth, dull finish. As the dragon grows older, the scales become large, thick, and as strong as metal. The neck frill and wings are an ash blue or purple-gray toward the edges, becoming darker with age. The pupils of a red dragon fade as it ages; the oldest red dragons have eyes that resemble molten lava orbs.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Combat\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Combat</h5></p><p>Because red dragons are so confident, they seldom pause to appraise an adversary. On spotting a target, they make a snap decision whether to attack, using one of many strategies worked out ahead of time. A red dragon lands to attack small, weak creatures with its claws and bite rather than obliterating them with its breath weapon, so as not to destroy any treasure they might be carrying.</p><div topic=\"Breath Weapon\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Breath Weapon (Su):</b> A red dragon has one type of breath weapon, a cone of fire.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Locate Object\" level=\"8\"><p><b><i>Locate Object</i> (Sp):</b> A juvenile or older red dragon can use this ability as the spell of the same name, once per day per age category.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Other Spell-Like Abilities\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Other Spell-Like Abilities:</b> 3/day-<i>suggestion</i> (old or older); 1/day-<i>find the path</i> (ancient or older), <i>discern location</i> (great wyrm).</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Skills\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Skills:</b> Appraise, Bluff, and Jump are considered class skills for red dragons.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 MonstersDr-Dw');
INSERT INTO monster VALUES (256,'Dragon, True','Red Dragon, Great wyrm',NULL,'Colossal','Dragon','Fire','40d12+400 (660 hp)','+4','40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)','41 (-8 size, +39 natural), touch 2, flat-footed 41','+40','+73','Bite +50 (4d8+17) melee','Bite +50 (4d8+17) melee, 2 Claws +50 (4d6+8) melee, 2 Wings +49 (2d8+8) melee, Tail Slap +49 (4d6+25) melee','30 ft.','20 ft. (30 ft. with bite)','Breath weapon (70 ft. cone of fire 24d10, DC 40), crush 4d8+25 (DC 40), frightful presence (DC 38), tail sweep 2d8+25 (DC 40)','Blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 20/magic, darkvision 120 ft., discern location, find the path, immunity to fire, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, locate object, spell resistance 32, spells (caster level 19th), suggestion, vulnerability to cold','Fort +32, Ref +22, Will +30','Str 45, Dex 10, Con 31, Int 26, Wis 27, Cha 26','Appraise +50, Bluff +49, Concentration +52, Diplomacy +50, Escape Artist +42, Intimidate +50, Jump +58, Knowledge (any 3) +51, Listen +53, Search +51, Sense Motive +50, Spot +53, Use Magic Device +50',NULL,'Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Combat Reflexes, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Wingover',NULL,'Warm mountains','Solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)','26','Triple standard','Always chaotic evil','41+ HD (Colossal)','-','Blindsense (Ex), Breath Weapon (Su), Crush (Ex), Frightful Presence (Ex), Immunities (Ex), Keen Senses (Ex), Locate Object (Sp), Spell Resistance (Ex), Tail Sweep (Ex)','Great wyrm red dragon; CR 26; Colossal dragon (fire); HD 40d12+400; hp 660; Init +4; Spd 40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy); AC 41 (-8 size, +39 natural), touch 2, flat-footed 41; Base Atk +40; Grp +73; Atk +50 melee (4d8+17, bite); Full Atk +50 melee (4d8+17, bite) and +50 melee (4d6+8, 2 claws) and +49 melee (2d8+8, 2 wings) and +49 melee (4d6+25, tail slap); Space/Reach 30 ft./20 ft. (30 ft. with bite); SA Breath weapon (70 ft. cone of fire 24d10, DC 40), crush 4d8+25 (DC 40), frightful presence (DC 38), tail sweep 2d8+25 (DC 40); SQ Blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 20/magic, darkvision 120 ft., discern location, find the path, immunity to fire, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, locate object, spell resistance 32, spells (caster level 19th), suggestion, vulnerability to cold; AL CE; SV Fort +32, Ref +22, Will +30; Str 45, Dex 10, Con 31, Int 26, Wis 27, Cha 26\n\nSkills and Feats: Appraise +50, Bluff +49, Concentration +52, Diplomacy +50, Escape Artist +42, Intimidate +50, Jump +58, Knowledge (any 3) +51, Listen +53, Search +51, Sense Motive +50, Spot +53, Use Magic Device +50; Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Combat Reflexes, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Wingover','\n      <div topic=\"Red Dragon\" level=\"4\"><p><h4>Red Dragon</h4></p><p/><p/><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Red Dragon, Great wyrm</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Colossal Dragon (Fire)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>40d12+400 (660 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td><td>41 (-8 size, +39 natural), touch 2, flat-footed 41<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td><td>+40/+73<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +50 (4d8+17) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +50 (4d8+17) melee, 2 Claws +50 (4d6+8) melee, 2 Wings +49 (2d8+