+42 (4d6+12) melee, 2 Claws +42 (2d8+6) melee, 2 Wings +41 (2d6+6) melee, Tail Slap +41 (2d8+18) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td><td>20 ft./15 ft. (20 ft. with bite)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td><td>Breath weapon (60 ft. cone of cold 11d6, DC 33), crush 4d6+18 (DC 33), frightful presence (DC 29), tail sweep 2d6+18 (DC 33)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td><td>Blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 20/magic, darkvision 120 ft., <i>fog cloud</i>, <i>freezing fog</i>, <i>gust of wind</i>, icewalking, immunity to cold, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, spell resistance 25, spells (caster level 11th), vulnerability to fire, <i>wall of ice</i><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td><td>Fort +25, Ref +18, Will +20<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td><td>Str 35, Dex 10, Con 25, Int 14, Wis 15, Cha 16<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td><td>Concentration +23, Diplomacy +18, Escape Artist +15, Hide +3, Intimidate +19, Knowledge (any 2) +38, Listen +40, Move Silently +15, Search +38, Sense Motive +18, Spot +40, Swim +27, Use Magic Device +18<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td><td>Alertness, Blind-Fight, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Wingover<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td><td>Cold mountains<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td><td>Solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td><td>19<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td><td>Triple standard<br/></t