Str 15, Dex 10, Con 15, Int 12, Wis 13, Cha 12<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td><td>Bluff +5, Concentration +7, Diplomacy +5, Escape Artist +4, Gather Information +5, Intimidate +6, Knowledge (any 1) +14, Listen +16, Search +14, Sense Motive +6, Spot +16, Survival +5, Use Magic Device +5<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td><td>Alertness, Hover, Improved Initiative, Weapon Focus (bite)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td><td>Warm deserts<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td><td>Solitary or clutch (2-5)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td><td>6<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td><td>Triple standard<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td><td>Always chaotic good<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td><td>11-12 HD (Medium)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n\n</table><p/><p/><p/><p/><div topic=\"Dragon\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Dragon (Fire)</b></p>\n</div><div topic=\"Environment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Environment:</b> Warm deserts</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Organization\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Organization:</b> Wyrmling, very young, young, juvenile, and young adult: solitary or clutch (2-5); adult, mature adult, old, very old, ancient, wyrm, or great wyrm: solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Challenge Ratings\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Challenge Ratings:</b> Wyrmling 3; very young 4; young 6; juvenile 8; young adult 10; adult 12; mature adult 15; old 17; very old 19; ancient 20; wyrm 21; great wyrm 23</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Treasure\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Treasure:</b> Triple standard</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Alignment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alignment:</b> Always c