(2d6+5) melee, 2 Wings +40 (1d8+5) melee, Tail Slap +40 (2d6+16) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td><td>15 ft./10 ft. (15 ft. with bite)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td><td>Breath weapon (50 ft. cone of sleep or 100 ft. line of fire 10d6, DC 31), crush 2d8+16 (DC 31), frightful presence (DC 29)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td><td>15/magic, blindsense 60 ft., <i>control weather</i>, <i>control winds</i>, damage reduction 10/magic, darkvision 120 ft., <i>endure elements</i>, immunity to fire, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, <i>speak with animals</i>, spell resistance 27, spells (caster level 15th), <i>suggestion</i>, vulnerability to cold<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td><td>Fort +23, Ref +17, Will +21<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td><td>Str 33, Dex 10, Con 23, Int 18, Wis 19, Cha 18<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td><td>Bluff +24, Concentration +27, Diplomacy +25, Escape Artist +21, Gather Information +24, Intimidate +25, Knowledge (any 2) +38, Listen +40, Search +38, Sense Motive +25, Spot +40, Survival +24, Use Magic Device +25<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td><td>Alertness, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Wingover<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td><td>Warm deserts<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td><td>Solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td><td>20<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td><td>Triple standard<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td><td>Always chaotic good<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td><td>32-33 HD (Huge)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td><td>-<br/></td></tr>\n\n</table><p/><div topic=\"Dragon\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Dragon (Fire)</b></p>\n</div><div topic=\"Environment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Environment:</b> Warm deserts</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Organization\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Organization:</b> Wyrmling, very young, young, juvenile, and young adult: solitary or clutch (2-5); adult, mature adult, old, very old, ancient, wyrm, or great wyrm: solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Challenge Ratings\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Challenge Ratings:</b> Wyrmling 3; very young 4; young 6; juvenile 8; young adult 10; adult 12; mature adult 15; old 17; very old 19; ancient 20; wyrm 21; great wyrm 23</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Treasure\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Treasure:</b> Triple standard</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Alignment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alignment:</b> Always chaotic good</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Advancement\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Advancement:</b> Wyrmling 5-6 HD; very young 8-9 HD; young 11-12 HD; juvenile 14-15 HD; young adult 17-18 HD; adult 20-21 HD; mature adult 23-24 HD; old 26-27 HD; very old 29-30 HD; ancient 32-33 HD; wyrm 35-36 HD; great wyrm 38+ HD</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Level Adjustment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Level Adjustment:</b> Wyrmling +2; very young +3; young +4; juvenile +4; others -</p><p/>\n</div><div topic=\"Brass Dragons by Age\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Brass Dragons by Age</h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td><b>Age</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Size</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Hit Dice (hp)</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Str</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Dex</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Con</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Int</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>W