ite)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td><td>Breath weapon (50 ft. cone of weakening gas or 50 ft. cone of fire 10d10, DC 25), crush 2d8+15 (DC 25), frightful presence (DC 24)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td><td>1st, alternate form, <i>bless</i>, blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 5/magic, darkvision 120 ft., immunity to fire, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, spell resistance 21, spells (caster level 5th), vulnerability to cold, water breathing<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td><td>Fort +17, Ref +12, Will +16<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td><td>Str 31, Dex 10, Con 21, Int 18, Wis 19, Cha 18<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td><td>Concentration +19, Diplomacy +18, Disguise +18, Escape Artist +14, Heal +18, Intimidate +18, Knowledge (any 2) +27, Listen +29, Search +27, Sense Motive +18, Spot +29, Swim +24, Use Magic Device +18<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td><td>Alertness, Empower Spell, Hover, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td><td>Warm plains<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td><td>Solitary or clutch (2-5)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td><td>14<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td><td>Triple standard<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td><td>Always lawful good<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td><td>21-22 HD (Huge)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td><td>-<br/></td></tr>\n\n</table><p/><p/><p/><div topic=\"Dragon\" l