2d8, DC 26), crush 2d8+12 (DC 26), frightful presence (DC 26); SQ Alternate form, blindsense 60 ft., cloudwalking, damage reduction 5/magic, darkvision 120 ft., feather fall, fog cloud, immunity to acid and cold, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, spell resistance 22, spells (caster level 7th), vulnerability to fire; AL LG; SV Fort +18, Ref +13, Will +18; Str 27, Dex 10, Con 21, Int 20, Wis 21, Cha 20\n\nSkills and Feats: Bluff +22, Concentration +23, Diplomacy +23, Disguise +22, Escape Artist +17, Intimidate +23, Jump +25, Knowledge (any 2) +30, Listen +32, Search +30, Sense Motive +23, Spot +32, Use Magic Device +22; Alertness, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)','\n      <div topic=\"Silver Dragon\" level=\"4\"><p><h4>Silver Dragon</h4></p><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Silver Dragon, Adult</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Huge Dragon (Cold)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>22d12+110 (253 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td><td>29 (-2 size, +21 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 29<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td><td>+22/+38<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +29 (2d8+8) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +29 (2d8+8) melee, 2 Claws +29 (2d6+4) melee, 2 Wings +28 (1d8+4) melee, Tail Slap +28 (2d6+12) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td><td>15 ft./10 ft. (15 ft. with bite)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td><td>Breath weapon (50 ft. cone of paralyzing gas or 50 ft. cone of cold 12d8, DC 26), crush 2d8+12 (DC 26), frightful presence (DC 26)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td><td>Alternate form, blindsense 60 ft., cloudwalking, damage reduction 5/magic, darkvision 120 ft., <i>feather fall</i>, <i>fog cloud</i>, immunity to acid and cold, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, spell resistance 22, spells (caster level 7th), vulnerability to fire<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td><td>Fort +18, Ref +13, Will +18<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td><td>Str 27, Dex 10, Con 21, Int 20, Wis 21, Cha 20<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td><td>Bluff +22, Concentration +23, Diplomacy +23, Disguise +22, Escape Artist +17, Intimidate +23, Jump +25, Knowledge (any 2) +30, Listen +32, Search +30, Sense Motive +23, Spot +32, Use Magic Device +22<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td><td>Alertness, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td><td>Temperate mountains<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td><td>Solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td><td>15<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td><td>Triple standard<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td><td>Always lawful good<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td><td>23-24 HD (Huge)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td><td>-<br/></td></tr>\n\n</table><p/><p/><p/><div topic=\"Dragon\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Dragon (Cold)</b></p>\n</div><div topic=\"Environment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Environment:</b> Temperate mountains</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Organization\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Organization:</b> Wyrmling, very young, young, juvenile, and young adult: solitary or clutch (2-5); adult, mature adult, old, very old, ancient, wyrm, or great wyrm: solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Challenge Ratings\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Challenge Ratings:</b> Wyrmling 4; very young 5; young 7; juvenile 10; young adult 13; adult 15; mature adult 18; old 20; very old 21; ancient 23; wyrm 24; great wyrm 26</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Treasure\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Treasure:</b> Triple standard</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Alignment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alignment:</b> Always lawful good</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Advancement\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Advancement:</b> Wyrmling 8-9 HD; very young 11-12 HD; young 14-15 HD; juvenile 17-18 HD; young adult 20-21 HD; adult 23-24 HD; mature adult 26-27 HD; old 29-30 HD; very old 32-33 HD; ancient 35-36 HD; wyrm 38-39 HD; great wyrm 41+ HD</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Level Adjustment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Level Adjustment:</b> Wyrmling +4; very young +4; young +5; others -</p><p/>\n</div><div topic=\"Silver Dragons by Age\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Silver Dragons by Age</h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td><b>Age</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Size</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Hit Dice (hp)</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Str</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Dex</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Con</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Int</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Wis</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Cha</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Base Attack/</b><br/>\n<b>Grapple</b><br/></td> <td><b>Attack</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Fort Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Ref Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Will Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Breath Weapon (DC)</