 maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +48 (4d6+14) melee, 2 Claws +48 (2d8+7) melee, 2 Wings +47 (2d6+7) melee, Tail Slap +47 (2d8+21) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td><td>20 ft./15 ft. (20 ft. with bite)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td><td>Breath weapon (60 ft. cone of paralyzing gas or 60 ft. cone of cold 22d8, DC 37), crush 4d6+21 (DC 37), frightful presence (DC 37), tail sweep 2d6+21 (DC 37)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td><td>Alternate form, blindsense 60 ft., cloudwalking, <i>control weather</i>, <i>control winds</i>, damage reduction 20/magic, darkvision 120 ft., <i>feather fall</i>, <i>fog cloud</i>, immunity to acid and cold, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, spell resistance 30, spells (caster level 17th), vulnerability to fire<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td><td>Fort +29, Ref +20, Will +29<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td><td>Str 39, Dex 10, Con 29, Int 28, Wis 29, Cha 28<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td><td>Bluff +49, Concentration +49, Diplomacy +49, Disguise +49, Escape Artist +40, Intimidate +49, Jump +54, Knowledge (any 4) +49, Listen +51, Search +49, Sense Motive +49, Spot +51, Use Magic Device +49<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td><td>Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Wingover<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td><td>Temperate mountains<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td><td>Solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td>