ooted 22<br/></td>\n<td/>\n<td>1st<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Juvenile<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>24 (-1 size, +15 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 24<br/></td>\n<td><i>Feather fall</i><br/></td>\n<td>3rd<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Young adult<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>27 (-1 size, +18 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 27<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 5/magic<br/></td>\n<td>5th<br/></td>\n<td>20<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Adult<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>29 (-2 size, +21 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 29<br/></td>\n<td><i>Fog cloud</i><br/></td>\n<td>7th<br/></td>\n<td>22<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Mature adult<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>32 (-2 size, +24 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 32<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 10/magic<br/></td>\n<td>9th<br/></td>\n<td>24<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Old<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>35 (-2 size, +27 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 35<br/></td>\n<td><i>Control winds</i><br/></td>\n<td>11th<br/></td>\n<td>26<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Very old<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>38 (-2 size, +30 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 38<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 15/magic<br/></td>\n<td>13th<br/></td>\n<td>27<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Ancient<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>39 (-4 size, +33 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 39<br/></td>\n<td><i>Control weather</i><br/></td>\n<td>15th<br/></td>\n<td>29<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Wyrm<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>42 (-4 size, +36 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 42<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 20/magic<br/></td>\n<td>17th<br/></td>\n<td>30<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Great wyrm<br/></td>\n<td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>41 (-8 size, +39 natural), touch 2, flat-footed 41<br/></td>\n<td><i>Reverse gravity</i><br/></td>\n<td>19th<br/></td>\n<td>32<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"2\">\n<td colspan=\"7\">*Can also cast cleric spells and those from the Air, Good, Law, and Sun domains as arcane spells.<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n</table><p>A silver wyrmling\'s scales are blue-gray with silver highlights. As the dragon approaches adulthood, its color gradually brightens until the individual scales are scarcely visible.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Combat\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Combat</h5></p><p>Silver dragons are not violent and avoid combat except when faced with highly evil or aggressive foes. If necessary, they use <i>fog cloud</i> or <i>control weather</i> to blind or confuse opponents before attacking. When angry, they use <i>reverse gravity</i> to fling enemies helplessly into the air, where they can be snatched. Against flying opponents, a silver dragon hides in clouds (creating some with <i>control weather</i> on clear days), then jumps to the attack when it has the advantage.</p><div topic=\"Breath Weapon\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Breath Weapon (Su):</b> A silver dragon has two types of breath weapon, a cone of cold and a cone of paralyzing gas. Creatures within a cone of paralyzing gas must succeed on a Fortitude save or be paralyzed for 1d6 rounds plus 1 round per age category of the dragon.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Alternate Form\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alternate Form (Su):</b> A silver dragon can assume any animal or humanoid form of Medium size or smaller as a standard action three times per day. This ability functions as a <i>polymorph</i> spell cast on itself at its caster level, except that the dragon does not regain hit points for changing form and can only assume the form of an anirmal or humanoid. The dragon can remain in its animal or humanoid form until it chooses to assume a new one or return to its natural form.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Cloudwalking\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Cloudwalking (Su):</b> A silver dragon can tread on clouds or fog as though on solid ground. The ability functions continuously but can be negated or resumed at will.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Spell-Like Abilities\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Spell-Like Abilities:</b> 3/day-<i>fog cloud</i> (adult or older), <i>control winds</i> (old or older); 2/day-<i>feather fall</i> (juvenile or older); 1/day- <i>control weather</i> (ancient or older), <i>reverse gravity</i> (great wyrm).</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Skills\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Skills:</b> Bluff, Disguise, and Jump are considered class skills for silver dragons.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 MonstersDr-Dw');
INSERT INTO monster VALUES (328,'Dragon, True','Silver Dragon, Great wyrm',NULL,'Colossal','Dragon','Cold','40d12+400 (660 hp)','+4','40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)','41 (-8 size, +39 natural), touch 2, flat-footed 41','+40','+72','Bite +49 (4d8+16) melee','Bite +49 (4d8+16) melee, 2 Claws +49 (4d6+8) melee, 2 Wings +48 (2d8+8) melee, Tail Slap +48 (4d6+24) melee','30 ft.','20 ft. (30 ft. with bite)','Breath weapon (70 ft. cone of paralyzing gas or 70 ft. cone of cold 24d8, DC 40), crush 4d8+24 (DC 40), frightful presence (DC 40), tail sweep 2d8+24 (DC 40)','Alternate form, blindsense 60 ft., cloudwalking, control weather, control winds, damage reduction 20/magic, darkvision 120 ft., feather fall, fog cloud, immunity to acid and cold, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, reverse gravity, spell resistance 32, spells (caster level 19th), vulnerability to fire','Fort +32, Ref +22, Will +32','Str 43, Dex 10, Con 31, Int 30, Wis 31, Cha 30','Bluff +53, Concentration +53, Diplomacy +53, Disguise +53, Escape Artist +43, Intimidate +53, Jump +59, Knowledge (any 5) +53, Listen +55, Search +53, Sense Motive +53, Spot +55, Use Magic Device +53',NULL,'Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Combat Reflexes, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Wingover',NULL,'Temperate mountains','Solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)','26','Triple standard','Always lawful good','41+ HD (Colossal)','-','Alternate Form (Su), Blindsense (Ex), Breath Weapon (Su), Cloudwalking (Su), Crush (Ex), Frightful Presence (Ex), Immunities (Ex), Keen Senses (Ex), Spell Resistance (Ex), Tail Sweep (Ex)','Great wyrm silver dragon; CR 26; Colossal dragon (cold); HD 40d12+400; hp 660; Init +4; Spd 40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy); AC 41 (-8 size, +39 natural), touch 2, flat-footed 41; Base Atk +40; Grp +72; Atk +49 melee (4d8+16, bite); Full Atk +49 melee (4d8+16, bite) and +49 melee (4d6+8, 2 claws) and +48 melee (2d8+8, 2 wings) and +48 melee (4d6+24, tail slap); Space/Reach 30 ft./20 ft. (30 ft. with bite); SA Breath weapon (70 ft. cone of paralyzing gas or 70 ft. cone of cold 24d8, DC 40), crush 4d8+24 (DC 40), frightful presence (DC 40), tail sweep 2d8+24 (DC 40); SQ Alternate form, blindsense 60 ft., cloudwalking, control weather, control winds, damage reduction 20/magic, darkvision 120 ft., feather fall, fog cloud, immunity to acid and cold, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, reverse gravity, spell resistance 32, spells (caster level 19th), vulnerability to fire; AL LG; SV Fort +32, Ref +22, Will +32; Str 43, Dex 10, Con 31, Int 30, Wis 31, Cha 30\n\nSkills and Feats: Bluff +53, Concentration +53, Diplomacy +53, Disguise +53, Escape Artist +43, Intimidate +53, Jump +59, Knowledge (any 5) +53, Listen +55, Search +53, Sense Motive +53, Spot +55, Use Magic Device +53; Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Combat Reflexes, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Wingover','\n      <div topic=\"Silver Dragon\" level=\"4\"><p><h4>Silver Dragon</h4></p><p/><p/><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Silver Dragon, Great wyrm</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Colossal Dragon (Cold)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>40d12+400 (660 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td><td>41 (-8 size, +39 natural), touch 2, flat-footed 41<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td><td>+40/+72<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +49 (4d8+16) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +49 (4d8+16) melee, 2 Claws +49 (4d6+8) melee, 2 Wings +48 (2d8+8) melee, Tail Slap +48 (4d6+24) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td><td>30 ft./20 ft. (30 ft. with bite)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td><td>Breath weapon (70 ft. cone of paralyzing gas or 70 ft. cone of cold 24d8, DC 40), crush 4d8+24 (DC 40), frightful presence (DC 40), tail sweep 2d8+24 (DC 40)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td><td>Alternate form, blindsense 60 ft., cloudwalking, <i>control weather</i>, <i>control winds</i>, damage reduction 20/magic, darkvision 120 ft., <i>feather fall</i>, <i>fog cloud</i>, immunity to acid and cold, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, <i>reverse gravity</i>, spell resistance 32, spells (caster level 19th), vulnerability to fire<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td><td>Fort +32, Ref +22, Will +32<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td><td>Str 43, Dex 10, Con 31, Int 30, Wis 31, Cha 30<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td><td>Bluff +53, Concentration +53, Diplomacy +53, Disguise +53, Escape Artist +43, Intimidate +53, Jump +59, Knowledge (any 5) +53, Listen +55, Search +53, Sense Motive +53, Spot +55, Use Magic Device +53<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td><td>Alertness, Blind-Fight, Cleave, Combat Reflexes, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Wingover<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td><td>Temperate mountains<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td><td>Solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td><td>26<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td><td>Triple standard<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td><td>Always lawful good<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td><td>41+ HD (Colossal)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td><td>-<br/></td></tr>\n\n</table><p/><div topic=\"Dragon\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Dragon (Cold)</b></p>\n</div><div topic=\"Environment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Environment:</b> Temperate mountains</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Organization\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Organization:</b> Wyrmling, very young, young, juvenile, and young adult: solitary or clutch (2-5); adult, mature adult, old, very old, ancient, wyrm, or great wyrm: solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Challenge Ratings\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Challenge Ratings:</b> Wyrmling 4; very young 5; young 7; juvenile 10; young adult 13; adult 15; mature adult 18; old 20; very old 21; ancient 23; wyrm 24; great wyrm 26</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Treasure\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Treasure:</b> Triple standard</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Alignment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alignment:</b> Always lawful good</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Advancement\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Advancement:</b> Wyrmling 8-9 HD; very young 11-12 HD; young 14-15 HD; juvenile 17-18 HD; young adult 20-21 HD; adult 23-24 HD; mature adult 26-27 HD; old 29-30 HD; very old 32-33 HD; ancient 35-36 HD; wyrm 38-39 HD; great wyrm 41+ HD</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Level Adjustment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Level Adjustment:</b> Wyrmling +4; very young +4; young +5; others -</p><p/>\n</div><div topic=\"Silver Dragons by Age\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Silver Dragons by Age</h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame