rests<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td>\n\n\n<td>(same as human form)<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td>\n\n\n<td>5<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td>\n\n\n<td>Standard<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td>\n\n\n<td>Always lawful good<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td>\n\n\n<td>By character class<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td>\n\n\n<td>+3<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n</table><p>Werebears in humanoid form tend to be stout, well-muscled, and hairy. Their brown hair is thick, and males usually wear beards. They may have reddish, blond, ivory, or black hair, matching the color of the ursine form. They dress in simple cloth and leather garments that are easy to remove, repair, or replace</p><div topic=\"Combat\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Combat</h5></p><p>Werebears fight just as brown bears do in animal form. In humanoid or hybrid form, they favor large, heavy weapons such as greataxes or greatswords. The werebear\'s greataxe is a Medium weapon, so it can wield the axe in one hand in hybrid form.</p><div topic=\"Alternate Form\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alternate Form (Su)</b>: A werebear can assume the form of a brown bear or a bear-humanoid hybrid.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Bear Empathy\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Bear Empathy (Ex):</b> Communicate with bears and dire bears, and +4 racial bonus on Charisma-based checks against bears and dire bears.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Curse of Lycanthropy\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Curse of Lycanthropy (Su):</b> Any humanoid or giant hit by a werebear\'s bite attack in animal or hybrid form must succeed on a DC 15 Fortitude save or contract lycanthropy.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Improved Grab\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Improved Grab (Ex):</b> To use this ability, a werebear must be in bear form and must hit with a claw attack. It can then attempt to start a grapple as a free action without provoking an attack of opportunity.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Skills\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Skills:</b> Werebears have a +4 racial bonus on Swim checks in any bear form.</p><p>The werebear presented here is a 1st-level human warrior and natural lycanthrope, using the following base ability scores: Str 13, Dex 11, Con 12, Int 10, Wis 9, Cha 8.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 MonstersK-L');
INSERT INTO monster VALUES (467,'Lycanthrope','Wereboar, Human Form',NULL,'Medium','Humanoid','Human, Shapechanger','1d8+4 plus 3d8+12 (34 hp)','+0','20 ft. in scale mail (4 squares); base speed 30 ft.','18 (+2 natural, +4 scale mail, +2 heavy shield), touch 10, flat-footed 18','+3','+4','Battleaxe +4 melee (1d8+1/x3) or javelin +3 ranged (1d6+1)','Battleaxe +4 melee (1d8+1/x3) or javelin +3 ranged (1d6+1)','5 ft.','5 ft.','-','Alternate form, boar empathy, ferocity, low-light vision, scent','Fort +6, Ref +3, Will +3','Str 13, Dex 11, Con 12, Int 10, Wis 11, Cha 8','Handle Animal +3, Intimidate +3, Listen +5, Spot +4','Alertness, Iron Will','Improved Bull Rush, Power Attack, Toughness',NULL,'Temperate forests','Solitary, pair, brood (3-4), or troupe (2-4 plus 1-4 boars)','4','Standard','Always neutral','By character class','+3','Alternate Form (Su), Boar Empathy (Ex), Curse of Lycanthropy (Su), Ferocity (Ex)','Human form wereboar; CR 4; Medium humanoid (human, shapechanger); HD 1d8+4 plus 3d8+12; hp 34; Init +0; Spd 20 ft. in scale mail (4 squares); base speed 30 ft.; AC 18 (+2 natural, +4 scale mail, +2 heavy shield), touch 10, flat-footed 18; Base Atk +3; Grp +4; Atk +4 melee (1d8+1/x3, battleaxe) or +3 ranged (1d6+1, javelin); Full Atk +4 melee (1d8+1/x3, battleaxe) or +3 ranged (1d6+1, javelin); Space/Reach 5 ft./5 ft.; SA -; SQ Alternate form, boar empathy, ferocity, low-light vision, scent; AL N; SV Fort +6, Ref +3, Will +3; Str 13, Dex 11, Con 12, Int 10, Wis 11, Cha 8\n\nSkills and Feats: Handle Animal +3, Intimidate +3, Listen +5, Spot +4; Alertness, Improved Bull Rush, Iron Will, Power Attack, Toughness','\n      <div topic=\"Wereboar\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Wereboar</h3></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td/>\n<td><b>Wereboar, Human Form</b><br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td/>\n<td>Medium Humanoid (Human, Shapechanger)<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td>\n<td>1d8+4 plus 3d8+12 (34 hp)<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td>\n<td>20 ft. in scale mail (4 squares); base speed 30 ft.<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td>\n<td>18 (+2 natural, +4 scale mail, +2 heavy shield), touch 10, flat-footed 18<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td>\n<td>+3/+4<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td>\n<td>Battleaxe +4 melee (1d8+1/x3) or javelin +3 ranged (1d6+1)<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td>\n<td>Battleaxe +4 melee (1d8+1/x3) or javelin +3 ranged (1d6+1)<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td>\n<td>5 ft./5 ft.<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td>\n<td>Alternate form, boar empathy, ferocity, low-light vision, scent<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td>\n<td>Fort +6, Ref +3, Will +3<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td>\n<td>Str 13, Dex 11, Con 12, Int 10, Wis 11, Cha 8<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td>\n<td>Handle Animal +3, Intimidate +3, Listen +5, Spot +4<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td>\n<td>Alertness <sup>B</sup>, Improved Bull Rush, Iron Will <sup>B</sup>, Power Attack, Toughness<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td>\n<td>Temperate forests<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td>\n<td>Solitary, pair, brood (3-4), or troupe (2-4 plus 1-4 boars)<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td>\n<td>4<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td>\n<td>Standard<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td>\n<td>Always neutral<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td>\n<td>By character class<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td>\n<td>+3<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n</table><p>A wereboar in humanoid form tends to be a stocky, muscular individual of average height. It dresses in simple garments that are easy to remove, repair, or replace.</p><div topic=\"Combat\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Combat</h5></p><p>In any form, wereboars are as ferocious as normal boars. When in hybrid form, they fight with a weapon and their dangerous gore attack.</p><div topic=\"Alternate Form\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alternate Form (Su):</b> A wereboar can assume the form of a boar or a boar-humanoid hybrid.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Boar Empathy\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Boar Empathy (Ex):</b> Communicate with boars and dire boars, and +4 racial bonus on Charisma-based checks against boars and dire boars.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Curse of Lycanthropy\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Curse of Lycanthropy (Su):</b> Any humanoid or giant hit by the wereboar\'s gore attack in animal or hybrid form must succeed on a DC 15 Fortitude save or contract lycanthropy.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Ferocity\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Ferocity (Ex):</b> A wereboar is such a tenacious combatant that it continues to fight without penalty even while disabled or dying.</p><p>The wereboar presented here is a 1st-level human warrior and natural lycanthrope, using the following base ability scores: Str 13, Dex 11, Con 12, Int 10, Wis 9, Cha 8.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 MonstersK-L');
INSERT INTO monster VALUES (468,'Lycanthrope','Wereboar, Boar Form',NULL,'Medium','Humanoid','Human, Shapechanger','1d8+4 plus 3d8+12 (34 hp)','+0','40 ft. (8 squares)','18 (+8 natural), touch 10, flat-footed 18','+3','+6','Gore +6 melee (1d8+4)','Gore +6 melee (1d8+4)','5 ft.','5 ft.','Curse of lycanthropy','Alternate form, boar empathy, damage reduction 10/silver, ferocity, low-light vision, scent','Fort +9, Ref +3, Will +3','Str 17, Dex 11, Con 18, Int 10, Wis 11, Cha 8','Handle Animal +3, Intimidate +3, Listen +5, Spot +4',NULL,'(same as human form)',NULL,'Temperate forests','(same as human form)','4','Standard','Always neutral','By character class','+3','Alternate Form (Su), Boar Empathy (Ex), Curse of Lycanthropy (Su), Ferocity (Ex)','Boar form wereboar; CR 4; Medium humanoid (human, shapechanger); HD 1d8+4 plus 3d8+12; hp 34; Init +0; Spd 40 ft. (8 squares); AC 18 (+8 natural), touch 10, flat-footed 18; Base Atk +3; Grp +6; Atk +6 melee (1d8+4, gore); Full Atk +6 melee (1d8+4, gore); Space/Reach 5 ft./5 ft.; SA Curse of lycanthropy; SQ Alternate form, boar empathy, damage reduction 10/silver, ferocity, low-light vision, scent; AL N; SV Fort +9, Ref +3, Will +3; Str 17, Dex 11, Con 18, Int 10, Wis 11, Cha 8\n\nSkills and Feats: Handle Animal +3, Intimidate +3, Listen +5, Spot +4; (same as human form)','\n      <div topic=\"Wereboar\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Wereboar</h3></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td/>\n\n<td><b>Wereboar, Boar Form</b><br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td/>\n\n<td>Medium Humanoid (Human, Shapechanger)<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>1d8+4 plus 3d8+12 (34 hp)<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>40 ft. (8 squares)<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>18 (+8 natural), touch 10, flat-footed 18<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>+3/+6<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>Gore +6 melee (1d8+4)<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>Gore +6 melee (1d8+4)<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>5 ft./5 ft.<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>Curse of lycanthropy<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>Alternate form, boar empathy, damage reduction 10/silver, ferocity, low-light vision, scent<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>Fort +9, Ref +3, Will +3<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>Str 17, Dex 11, Con 18, Int 10, Wis 11, Cha 8<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>Handle Animal +3, Intimidate +3, Listen +5, Spot +4<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>(same as human form)<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>Temperate forests<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>(same as human form)<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>4<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>Standard<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>Always neutral<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>By character class<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td>+3<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n</table><p>A wereboar in humanoid form tends to be a stocky, muscular individual of average height. It dresses in simple garments that are easy to remove, repair, or replace.</p><div topic=\"Combat\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Combat</h5></p><p>In any form, wereboars are as ferocious as normal boars. When in hybrid form, they fight with a weapon and their dangerous gore attack.</p><div topic=\"Alternate Form\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alternate Form (Su):</b> A wereboar can assume the form of a boar or a boar-humanoid hybrid.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Boar Empathy\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Boar Empathy (Ex):</b> Communicate with boars and dire boars, and +4 racial bonus on Charisma-based checks against boars and dire boars.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Curse of Lycanthropy\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Curse of Lycanthropy (Su):</b> Any humanoid or giant hit by the wereboar\'s gore attack in animal or hybrid form must succeed on a DC 15 Fortitude save or contract lycanthropy.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Ferocity\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Ferocity (Ex):</b> A wereboar is such a tenacious combatant that it continues to fight without penalty even while disabled or dying.</p><p>The wereboar presented here is a 1st-level human warrior and natural lycanthrope, using the following base ability scores: Str 13, Dex 11, Con 12, Int 10, Wis 9, Cha 8.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 MonstersK-L');
